{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Ky708T3f4D1793699831.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>據報百度旗下崑崙芯推遲至明年才分拆上市。</p><p></p><p>公司早於1月以保密形式，向港交所遞交主板上市申請，《彭博》引述消息指，公司仍在準備招股，目前正等待監管機構批准，上市時間很可能推遲至明年。</p><p></p><p>百度發言人就否認報道，強調崑崙芯處於保密申報階段，根據監管要求不能披露上市進展等重大非公開信息，未來將適時對外公告。早前有消息指，公司計劃以500億美元估值招股，集資20億美元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T10:42:08.576594+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T09:56:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T16:38:29.329333+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T10:38:30.847132+00:00","content_hash":"1ffec74c635a0adbde2e80159357470cd6e31c44caca84061b974adc8b987308","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}